handling is recorded in docs/provenance.md.

- SponsorBlock (https://github.com/ajayyy/SponsorBlock), GPL-3.0 - the community segment-skip
  protocol (category vocabulary and the k-anonymity hash-prefix lookup) and the skip/undo
  interaction model.
- uBlock Origin (https://github.com/gorhill/uBlock), GPL-3.0 - the player-response pruning
  strategy, the page-world scriptlet coexistence approach, and the compact popup layout as a
  design reference.
- yt-dlp (https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp), The Unlicense - InnerTube client parameters (device
  personas) used by the credentialless media path, and format-selection behavior.

Consulted as references during research only, with no code incorporated: ImprovedTube
(code-charity/youtube), Iridium (ParticleCore/Iridium), youtube-music (th-ch), better-lyrics
(boidushya), Web Scrobbler (web-scrobbler), LuanRT/googlevideo, LuanRT/YouTube.js, and 1Password
(proprietary; product and design study). Behavior derived from closed products was captured as
specifications from observable behavior and public documentation before any implementation.
